\ by-assumption up to definitional equality: a + 0 unfolds to a (slice
\ a2-iii; tests/front/tactics/goal-layer.lean). The term is h.
\ Lean: theorem as_defeq (a : Nat) (h : a ≤ a) : a ≤ a + 0 := by assumption
theorem as_defeq
  Nat explicit: a
  a a ≤ explicit: h
  a a 0 + ≤
:= by
  by-assumption
end as_defeq
